    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="95f95168-dd30-5104-ab96-1d7cfdd2a163" activityNameId="f92ef92a-51e4-5215-83c4-86b1d526d149" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, sewer system, cast iron pipe, DN 600, profile 1</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, sewer system, cast iron pipe, DN 600, profile 1
Modern Swiss und European technologies are applied to building machines, material production and building processes. 
UUID: 251cc920-6be7-40fb-bb7a-2da320a4589d
This process models deconstruction and end-of-life treatment for 1 meter of installed sewer infrastructure with cast iron pipe. DN 600, profile 1 according to SIA 190. Trench depth: 3 meters. This process includes the deconstruction phase (C1), transport phase (C2), treatment/ recycling phase (C3), and final disposal phase (C4) for 1 meter of sewer system with cast iron pipe, DN 600, profile 1. The operation of similar types of building machines across different processes is aggregated to one process.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: DN 600, profile 1 according to SIA 190.Trench depth 3 meters. Cast iron pipe, ID 600 mm, outer diameter 626mm, wall thickness 13 mm, 180 kg/m, 7200 kg/m³
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_251cc920-6be7-40fb-bb7a-2da320a4589d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
